# Valki's enters trigger has the opponent reveal their hand and Bot1 exile a creature card from it (the Grizzly Bears, not the
# Llanowar Elves or the Lightning Bolt) until Valki leaves (CR 701.20, 610.3). {X} chooses among the creature cards exiled with
# Valki with mana value exactly X: X=1 matches nothing (the Bears are 2) and Valki stays Valki, X=2 makes it a copy of the Bears
# (CR 707.2). When Bot2 bolts it, the Bears return to Bot2's hand (CR 610.3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Valki, God of Lies
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Island x3
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Valki, God of Lies.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
? Exile = Grizzly Bears
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
? Bot2.Revealed = Grizzly Bears; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt; Llanowar Elves; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Valki, God of Lies.Activate(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Valki, God of Lies.Toughness = 1
? Exile = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Valki, God of Lies.Activate(X: 2)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Valki, God of Lies = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 2
? Exile = Grizzly Bears
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Valki, God of Lies
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears = (absent)
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
